{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15124","headline":"将赴朔方早发汉武泉 · 李益","name":"将赴朔方早发汉武泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弭盖出故关，穷秋首边路。\n问我此何爲，平生重一顾。\n风吹山下草，系马河边树。\n奉役良有期，回瞻终未屡。\n去乡幸未远，戎衣今已故。\n岂惟幽朔寒，念我机中素。\n去矣勿复言，所酬知音遇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}